\v 1 In¦376324 the¦376325 eighth¦376325 month¦376324 of the second year¦376326 of¦376328 \add the reign of Persian King\add* Dareyavesh¦376328 \add !(Darius¦376328)\add*, Yahweh¦376332 \add ≈spoke through\add* the¦376342 prophet¦376342 Zekaryah¦376335 (\add Zechariah,\add* son of¦376339 Iddo's¦376341 son Berekyah¦376338) saying¦376343,\x + \xo 1:1: \xt Ezr 4:24–5:1; 6:14.\x*
